# Architectural Conventions

- The flow of raw data must go: Scraper Trigger -> Collector -> Health Validator (with Self-Healing fallback) -> Normalizer -> Intelligence Scoring -> Time-Series DB.
- Any change to the API payload shape must update `docs/mock_schema.json` and `docs/api-contract.md` first.
- Keep the components decoupled:
  - Scraper logic stays in `backend/app/scraper/`
  - Processing logic stays in `backend/app/processor/`
